# {{TITLE}}

Lean formalization of [the paper]({{SOURCE_URL}}). Entry point: `{{NAMESPACE}}.lean`.

## Results

Add the implemented source results and exact public Lean declarations here and in publication.json. This template contains no claimed paper result.

## Build

From this directory:

```sh
python3 ../../scripts/verify.py --paper {{ID}} --check build
```

## Assumptions

Document external theorems, their hypotheses and use sites in [EXTERNAL_DEPENDENCIES.md](EXTERNAL_DEPENDENCIES.md).

## Verification

Add independent fixed statement specifications and genuine negative controls, then run:

```sh
python3 ../../scripts/verify.py --paper {{ID}} --check static
python3 ../../scripts/verify.py --paper {{ID}} --check comparator --local
```

See [verification](../../docs/verification.md) for prerequisites and the meaning of each check.

